\f0\fs28 QUESTION UPLOAD TEMPLATE\par
\fs22 Online Exam Portal\par
\par
IMPORTANT\par
This is a Word-compatible template for preparing questions and answers. The current application bulk endpoint accepts JSON, not Word files. After completing this document, convert each question to the JSON format shown in README.md, or add a Word parser before wiring a file upload control.\par
\par
SUPPORTED VALUES\par
Question type: single, multiple, truefalse, shortanswer, essay, fillinblank, matching\par
Difficulty: easy, medium, hard\par
\par
EXAMPLE 1 - SINGLE CHOICE\par
Question: Which language runs in a web browser?\par
Type: single\par
Difficulty: easy\par
Marks: 1\par
Option A: JavaScript | Correct: yes\par
Option B: Python | Correct: no\par
Option C: SQL | Correct: no\par
Option D: C++ | Correct: no\par
Explanation: JavaScript is the standard language executed by web browsers.\par
\par
EXAMPLE 2 - MULTIPLE CHOICE\par
Question: Which are frontend technologies?\par
Type: multiple\par
Difficulty: medium\par
Marks: 2\par
Option A: React | Correct: yes\par
Option B: CSS | Correct: yes\par
Option C: MongoDB | Correct: no\par
Option D: Express | Correct: no\par
Explanation: React and CSS are used to build the browser interface.\par
\par
EXAMPLE 3 - TRUE OR FALSE\par
Question: HTML is a programming language.\par
Type: truefalse\par
Difficulty: easy\par
Marks: 1\par
Option A: True | Correct: no\par
Option B: False | Correct: yes\par
Explanation: HTML is a markup language.\par
\par
EXAMPLE 4 - SHORT ANSWER\par
Question: What does API stand for?\par
Type: shortanswer\par
Difficulty: easy\par
Marks: 1\par
Correct answer: Application Programming Interface\par
Explanation: An API defines how software systems communicate.\par
\par
EXAMPLE 5 - FILL IN THE BLANK\par
Question: The capital of France is ____.\par
Type: fillinblank\par
Difficulty: easy\par
Marks: 1\par
Correct answer: Paris\par
Explanation: Paris is the capital city of France.\par
\par
EXAMPLE 6 - ESSAY\par
Question: Explain two benefits of automated testing.\par
Type: essay\par
Difficulty: hard\par
Marks: 5\par
Model answer: Automated tests provide repeatable feedback and help prevent regressions.\par
Explanation: Award marks for accuracy, examples, and clear reasoning.\par
\par
EXAMPLE 7 - MATCHING\par
Question: Match each technology to its primary use.\par
Type: matching\par
Difficulty: medium\par
Marks: 2\par
Pair 1: React -> User interface\par
Pair 2: MongoDB -> Document database\par
Pair 3: Express -> Node.js web framework\par
Explanation: Each technology is matched to its primary role.\par
